sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant AuthController
participant LoginUserService
participant UserRepository as IUserRepository / MongoUserRepository
participant PasswordHasher as PasswordHasher / BcryptPasswordHasher
participant TokenService as TokenService / JwtTokenService

User->>AuthController: POST /auth/login
AuthController->>LoginUserService: execute(command)
LoginUserService->>UserRepository: findByEmail(Email.create(email))
UserRepository-->>LoginUserService: user
LoginUserService->>PasswordHasher: compare(password, user.passwordHash)
PasswordHasher-->>LoginUserService: passwordsMatch
LoginUserService->>TokenService: generateToken({ sub, email })
TokenService-->>LoginUserService: accessToken
LoginUserService-->>AuthController: AuthenticationResult
AuthController-->>User: 200 { access_token }
